Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 05:54:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Arrange sheet layouts in the 3D viewport

Positioning drawings, schedules and references on a sheet required
opening the layout SVG in Inkscape. Edit Sheet Layout in the Sheets
panel now creates temporary real-size outlines of the sheet and of
every item placed on it, with their view titles, and isolates them in
the viewport seen from the top. Items are moved with the usual Blender
tools, such as snapping, alignment and typed values. Saving writes the
new positions to the layout SVG, keeping each view title's offset to
its item. Cancelling leaves the layout unchanged.

Closes #6428.

